==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Red EnerG]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The combination of Waves from Berserkory and Surges from Red EnerG makes this stage a bit of a nightmare. Due to the existence of both enemies, anti-Red Debuffers like [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]] won't get much value, unless you use Wave Blockers, though that won't work against the Surges. And since this is a Timed Score Rewards Stage, you'll need to be fast.

Non-Uber Red units you can use include [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] for easy area damage, [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi]]/talented [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Ultimate Bondage]] for tanking, and Double Money talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] to get a boost in money at the beginning. If you have anti-Red Units that are immune to Waves/Surges like [[Keiji Claus (Uber Rare Cat)|Keiji Claus]] and True Form [[Bunny & Canard (Uber Rare Cat)|Bunny and Canard]], they are also useful to bring.

